<div class="yi-stack">
<div role="alert" class="yi-alert yi-alert--danger yi-alert--soft">
<span class="yi-alert__icon">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="yi-icon">
<path d="M2 12a10 10 0 1 0 20 0a10 10 0 1 0 -20 0M12 8L12 12M12 16L12.01 16">
</path>
</svg>
</span>
<div class="yi-alert__body">
<div class="yi-alert__title">The agent could not reach the cluster</div>
<div class="yi-alert__message">
<p>The last successful refresh was 4 minutes ago.</p>
<ul>
<li>Check that the agent can resolve the cluster's address.</li>
<li>Confirm its token has not expired in <a href="#settings">Settings</a>.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div role="alert" class="yi-alert yi-alert--warn yi-alert--soft">
<span class="yi-alert__icon">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="yi-icon">
<path d="M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4zM16 7.5a0.5 0.5 0 1 0 1 0a0.5 0.5 0 1 0 -1 0">
</path>
</svg>
</span>
<div class="yi-alert__body">
<div class="yi-alert__title">This key is shown once</div>
<div class="yi-alert__message">Copy it now. It cannot be recovered after you leave this page.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div role="status" class="yi-alert yi-alert--info yi-alert--soft">
<div class="yi-alert__body">
<div class="yi-alert__message">Changes to routing take up to a minute to apply.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
